  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "web gallary reject over size images ( sticker: 1024^2, photo: 2048^2), its very annoying in some usecase.\n\nwhen I take photo in VRC, I want share it, oops, not gallary photo... ok upload from web... omg cannot upload only 2k size... need editing with VR overlay? too hard...\n\nSo its very high wall, at least gallary upload function need auto resizing.",
